<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-WESTERN PROVINCE 186-4 AT LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WESTERN PROVINCE 186-4 AT LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Province were 186 for four at lunch, needing a further 222 to beat Transvaal on the final day of the Supersport Series match at the Wanderers.</p>
<p>Scores: Transvaal 371 and 263-8 declared</p>
<p>Western Province 227 and 186-4 (Herschelle Gibbs 103, H.D. Ackerman 64 not out).</p>
